Third-party material
--------------------

None. Recall is written from scratch and contains no code from other projects.

Saver
-----

Recall is meant as a replacement for "Saver" by Piotr Machowski
(https://github.com/PiotrMachowski/Home-Assistant-custom-components-Saver, MIT License).
Only the idea of saving and restoring states is shared; no code from Saver is included.
The README explains how to move automations from Saver to Recall.

Tests
-----

Entity IDs, slot names and values in tests/ are made up.

